WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.827
Ama has six books and gets two more books. Join the groups.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.497
Six plus two equals eight. We add when groups join together.

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:12.311
Kojo has twelve oranges and gives away five.

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:17.164
Twelve minus five equals seven. Seven oranges remain.
